{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n66.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"34","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"By David when he disguised his sanity before Abimelech, who drove him away and he went: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"I will at all times bless the Lord, His fame shall always be in my mouth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"My soul glories in the Lord, let the humble hear and rejoice. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Magnify the Lord with me and let us exalt His Name together. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"I sought the Lord, and He answered me and saved me from all my terrors. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"When they look to Him, they are radiant and their faces are not shamed. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"This man called and the Lord hears and from all his troubles did He save him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"An angel of the Lord encamps around those that fear Him and rescued them. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Observe and perceive that the Lord is good, fortunate the man who trusts in Him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Fear the Lord, O His holy ones, for there is no want among those that fear Him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Though whelps may hunger and starve, those that seek the Lord will not lack all that is good. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Come, children, listen to me, the fear of the Lord will I teach you. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Who is the man that desires life, who longs for days to see goodness? "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Keep your tongue from evil and your lips from speaking guile, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"depart from evil and do good, seek peace and pursue it. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The eyes of the Lord are towards the righteous and His ears to their cry. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The countenance of the Lord is against evil-doers to cut off their memory from the earth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Men cry out and the Lord "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n68.jpg","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"listens and He delivered them from all their troubles. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord is near the broken-hearted, and those whose spirit is crushed, does He save. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/20","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Many are the sufferings of the righteous man but from all of them will the Lord deliver him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/21","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He guards all his bones, not one of them is broken. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/22","n":"22"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Evil slays the wicked; they that hate the righteous shall be found guilty. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/34/23","n":"23"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The Lord redeems the soul of His servants, and all who trust in Him shall not be found guilty. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
